===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A native or resident of  the American state of [[Indiana]].
# Someone associated with the {{w|Indiana University}}, for example as a student, alumnus, or sports team member, or as a fan.
# {{context|slang|St Louis, Missouri|lang=en}} An [[uneducated]], [[tasteless]] [[Caucasian]] person.

====Synonyms====
